# Line endings that must survive a Windows checkout (Git for Windows'
# default core.autocrlf=true). Shell scripts break on Linux with a CRLF
# shebang ("bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M"), and a game's package
# step refuses a bundle whose launchers, Python, TOML or env files carry
# CRLF (xboxrecomp-cli package/lib.py LF_ONLY): those files run or are
# read on Linux and macOS too. The shaders ship in every bundle beside them.
*.sh       text eol=lf
*.py       text eol=lf
*.in       text eol=lf
*.toml     text eol=lf
*.env      text eol=lf
*.default  text eol=lf
*.slang    text eol=lf
*.slangp   text eol=lf
